Third-party components

This repository documents a lab that uses the following open-source projects.
They are not redistributed here; they remain under their own licences and are
credited to their authors:

- sysmon-modular (Sysmon configuration) by Olaf Hartong, MIT License.
  https://github.com/olafhartong/sysmon-modular
- Atomic Red Team (adversary simulation tests) by Red Canary, MIT License.
  https://github.com/redcanaryco/atomic-red-team
- Sigma (generic detection rule format) by the SigmaHQ project,
  Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 for rule content.
  https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma
- Wazuh (SIEM / XDR) by Wazuh Inc., GNU GPLv2.
  https://github.com/wazuh/wazuh

The custom Wazuh rules, Sigma rules, documentation, and reports authored for
this project are released under the MIT License above.
